{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1657324800, "end_date": 1657929599, "month_true_total": 377, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:49:11 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "118876374", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994503225", "personaname": "Telifex", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/communist_llama/", "num_games_owned": 620, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 6001, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5514, "last_played": 1659537054, "avatar": "6330c0531c83e7262767b52a29728f6801bcc289"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good game, Lots of progression and replayability. \n\nOnly negative is the price of the game and DLC. $60 is a big ask for a game format that has been done to death. Definitely pick up for $40 or less on sale. DLC being $15 is also high.\n\n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1657927389, "timestamp_updated": 1657927389, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 8, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527338206768035889", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "118872746", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010274532", "personaname": "HappyJackington", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010274532/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 15232, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11974, "last_played": 1691287092, "avatar": "8c6f5f9650e8de6b05a3421cfe0d4877fc55ccf8"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is real good. The card system allows for a lot of replayability, and if you have a group of friends with you it's even better. The AI is a lot better than it was on release, which helps if you just want to stay in your group. Also the dev team is pretty active on making quality updates. There's still more DLC that's to come out too, and there's content that gets added for free as well.", "timestamp_created": 1657921292, "timestamp_updated": 1657921292, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "118871257", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148229214", "personaname": "P33bag", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198148229214/", "num_games_owned": 212, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2775, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2166, "last_played": 1677058397, "avatar": "30617a8f29bd75127a0e1b43da7d037a99909ebe"}, "language": "english", "review": "For what its worth it WAS a good game and i might still play it from time to time. However they took way too long to put out any meaningful content updates that actually mattered and expanded the game and made it more \"fun\". and whatever they had put out was super lack luster it kind of killed my interest for the game. Its a fun game but for what it does and what its marketed to be there are other games that do it better. But if its your first time playing a zombie/horde game and you have some buddies that are down to play it you may enjoy this allot. But if you're buying this for the online aspect just go play left4dead or similar titles you'll enjoy that allot more,", "timestamp_created": 1657919027, "timestamp_updated": 1657919027, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_st